      {
        "text": "There are many more suffering Gu on the path of life than on the path of death. On the path of death they grow fewer the further Ren Zu walks; on the path of life every step draws more of them to obstruct him. Courage Gu warns that there are too many, that there is peace in death but life has endless suffering, and that guts are needed as well as courage.",
