  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Wisdom Gu tells Ren Zu that there are many suffering Gu inside the path of life, that he must enter from the road of death, and that he needs courage Gu so he will not fear the torture of suffering.",
        "chapters": [
          410
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_wisdom_gu",
          "char_ren_zu",
          "gu_courage_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "On the road of death, a large number of suffering Gu swarm toward Ren Zu like yellow fireflies. Courage Gu shines brightly and chases them away.",
        "chapters": [
          410
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "A later legend stretch states that the Door of Life and Death has two routes, the road of life and the road of death, and that no matter which path it is there will be a lot of suffering Gu. To overcome their interference and enter deep into the door, courage Gu is needed.",
        "chapters": [
          722
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "both-roads",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_door_of_life_and_death"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan’s own summary of the Door of Life and Death keeps suffering Gu on the road of life but reverses the three obstacles onto the road of death.",
        "chapters": [
          1010
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "which-road-holds-what",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Another summary of wisdom Gu’s guidance to Ren Zu reverses it again, putting suffering Gu back on the road of death and the three obstacles on the road of life.",
        "chapters": [
          2192
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "which-road-holds-what",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
